# Every change to the catalog needs a skill-reviewers approval.
# GitHub will not let a pull request's author approve their own PR,
# so this team needs at least two members to function.
*                                   @HCMdesign/skill-reviewers

# The gate itself, and the fixture that proves it works.
#
# These are listed explicitly even though `*` already covers them, because a
# pull request can edit the gate's own configuration in the same commit that
# adds a skill: disabling a path_instruction, adding a path_filter that excludes
# plugins/ from review, or weakening the scan. A reviewer skimming a large skill
# diff can miss a one-line change to one of these files.
#
# Reviewers: a diff touching anything below is a change to the gate. Read it
# first, and read it on its own terms - not as part of whatever skill the pull
# request claims to be about.
/.github/                           @HCMdesign/skill-reviewers
/.coderabbit.yaml                   @HCMdesign/skill-reviewers
/.gitattributes                     @HCMdesign/skill-reviewers
/tests/tripwire/                    @HCMdesign/skill-reviewers
/.claude-plugin/marketplace.json    @HCMdesign/skill-reviewers
/provenance/                        @HCMdesign/skill-reviewers
